<tool id="genmol" name="GenMol" version="1.0" profile="21.05">
    <description>Generative molecular design using diffusion models</description>
    <requirements>
        <container type="docker">ghcr.io/biomate/genmol:1.0</container>
    </requirements>
    <command detect_errors="exit_code"><![CDATA[
        python '$__tool_directory__/scripts/genmol_wrapper.py'
        --mode '$task.mode'
        #if $task.mode == "unconditional"
        --num_molecules $task.num_molecules
        #else if $task.mode == "conditional"
        --target_property '$task.target_property'
        --target_value $task.target_value
        --num_molecules $task.num_molecules
        #else if $task.mode == "scaffold"
        --scaffold '$task.scaffold'
        --num_molecules $task.num_molecules
        #end if
        --output '$output'
    ]]></command>
    <inputs>
        <conditional name="task">
            <param name="mode" type="select" label="Generation mode">
                <option value="unconditional">Unconditional generation</option>
                <option value="conditional">Property-guided generation</option>
                <option value="scaffold">Scaffold-based generation</option>
            </param>
            <when value="unconditional">
                <param name="num_molecules" type="integer" value="100" min="1" max="1000" label="Number of molecules"/>
            </when>
            <when value="conditional">
                <param name="target_property" type="select" label="Target property">
                    <option value="logP">LogP (lipophilicity)</option>
                    <option value="qed">QED (drug-likeness)</option>
                    <option value="sa_score">SA Score (synthetic accessibility)</option>
                    <option value="mw">Molecular weight</option>
                </param>
                <param name="target_value" type="float" label="Target value"/>
                <param name="num_molecules" type="integer" value="100" min="1" max="1000" label="Number of molecules"/>
            </when>
            <when value="scaffold">
                <param name="scaffold" type="text" label="Scaffold SMILES"
                       help="SMILES string of the scaffold to decorate"/>
                <param name="num_molecules" type="integer" value="100" min="1" max="1000" label="Number of molecules"/>
            </when>
        </conditional>
    </inputs>
    <outputs>
        <data name="output" format="smi" label="${tool.name}: Generated molecules"/>
    </outputs>
    <help><![CDATA[
**GenMol: Generative Molecular Design**

GenMol uses diffusion models to generate novel drug-like molecules.

**Generation Modes:**
1. **Unconditional**: Generate diverse molecules
2. **Property-guided**: Generate molecules with target properties
3. **Scaffold-based**: Decorate a core scaffold

**Output:**
- SMILES file with generated molecules
- Each molecule is validated for chemical validity

**Applications:**
- Lead optimization
- Hit expansion
- Virtual library generation

**Citation:**
GenMol: Diffusion Models for Molecular Generation (2024)
    ]]></help>
</tool>
